WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.500
The command breaks. The Warden remembers its first oath.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Cartographer. You did not kill the heir.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
You carried her living memory into the Crown Paths.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Serath erased her name. The paths preserved what remained.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.000
The first path is restored. The road now turns inward.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Beyond the Veil, a kingdom without names is waiting.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Chapter II: The Inner Kingdom.
